title: "Aurora Image Classifier — VGG16-CNN for Indian Antarctic All-Sky Camera Images"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2024-07-18"

authors:
  - family-names: "SunilKumar"
    # given-names: "Sunil Kumar"       # ← Add your given name(s) here
    # affiliation: "National Centre for Polar and Ocean Research, Goa"       # ← Add your institution here
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"  # ← Add ORCID if available

abstract: >
  A fine-tuned VGG16 convolutional neural network for automated 7-class
  Classification of All-Sky Camera (ASC) auroral images from the Indian
  Antarctic Stations Maitri (70.77°S, 11.74°E). Classes include Arc, Discrete, 
  Diffused, Cloudy, Moon, Twilight, and No_Aurora. The model is trained on ImageNet 
  pre-trained VGG16 features with a custom GlobalAveragePooling + softmax head, 
  achieving a high macro F1-score on held-out validation data.

